      <li><strong>Forecasting and trend outputs</strong> — predictive or directional analysis relating to markets, culture, or consumer behaviour;</li>
      <li><strong>Strategic advisory</strong> — recommendations or strategic reports informed by our outputs; and</li>
      <li><strong>Measurement products</strong> — analysis of how brands, categories, or content are represented or discussed across third-party AI systems.</li>
    </ul>
    <p>We describe our Services here at a functional level only. We do not disclose, and these Terms should not be read as disclosing, the specific methods, models, architectures, datasets, or processes we use to generate outputs. Nothing in our marketing, investor, or public materials constitutes a specification of our technology, and no licence to use, replicate, or reverse-engineer it is granted by referencing it.</p>
