    </ul>
    <p>You must not extract, reconstruct, or otherwise derive the underlying data points from any chart, graph, or other visual provided under the second bullet above, and must not use any such data — whether extracted from a visual or otherwise obtained — for modelling, analysis, or any purpose beyond representing the results of the specific assignment described in your Order Form.</p>
